      "statement": "Rule 310 requires referral for business, commercial storage, manufacturing, repair, processing, public access, vacancy or unoccupancy, renovation, unrepaired structural or foundation conditions, roof or water concerns, plumbing and sanitation issues, mold, fungi, and rot.",
      "evidence": [
        {
