      "statement": "Rule 310 requires referral for electrical, heating, fuel, solid-fuel, pool, recreational, animal, firearm, vehicle, operator, rental, lodging, shared-occupancy, organized-event, fraud, identity, credit, investigation, inspection, protective-feature, unusual-construction, and other material-hazard conditions identified in the rule.",
